    "title_en": "Low separation axioms in primal spaces and the Zariski Topology",
    "abstract_en": "In this paper, we give characterizations of the primal spaces that satisfy some separation axioms between $T_0$ and $T_1$ in terms of the function that generates the topology, and we establish which axioms are equivalent in this context. We also give a characterization of the rings whose prime spectrum, endowed with the Zariski topology, is a primal space.",
